   - Complete ticket 05 verification: checkout form rendering, field labels/required asterisks, live validation message appearance/disappearance on blur, confirm-email re-validation on email change, Pay button states (valid/invalid/in-flight/success/failure), toast messages, POST `/reservations` payload correctness (summary-order seat ids, customer fields, total price), and value persistence across back/forward/reload — not yet tested in a browser.
