   - **Unsolved / actively in progress at cutoff**: the suspected seat-row off-by-one rendering discrepancy described in detail in section 4 above. The very last tool call's result (an empty array from the DOM-dump regex extraction) raised more questions than it answered and was the last thing I was investigating when the summary request interrupted the session. No conclusion has been reached, and no code has been changed in response to this specific issue yet.

6. All user messages:
