   - Complete ticket 05 verification: checkout form rendering, field labels/required asterisks, live validation message appearance/disappearance on blur, confirm-email re-validation on email change, Pay button states (valid/invalid/in-flight/success/failure), toast messages, POST `/reservations` payload correctness (summary-order seat ids, customer fields, total price), and value persistence across back/forward/reload — not yet tested in a browser.
   - Complete ticket 06 verification: confirmation page content, Continue clearing the booking and returning to `/`, booking persistence across a confirmation-page reload, and all three route guards (summary/checkout/confirmation) correctly redirecting to `/` when the booking doesn't match — not yet tested in a browser.
   - Perform ticket 07's "final pass": a full walkthrough of the entire flow against every acceptance criterion in spec/README.md section 10 (all ~69 ACs) and the complete `data-testid` contract in section 9, fixing anything that doesn't match, with `pnpm nx build cinescope` continuing to succeed throughout.
