   2. Based on visual row-counting against the printed row-label numbers, the red (unavailable) seats appeared to be one row lower than expected relative to screening 1's `occupiedSeats` (`R3C7-9`, `R6C12-13`, `R11C21-22` expected at rows 3/6/11, but appeared to align with labels 4/7/12 in the screenshot).
